  "description": "A famous idol died in a car crash. The only way for him to go to the heaven was to sing for a woman...whom he never crossed path with. The only clue he had was just a name. As if this wasn't challenging enough, his spirit could only be seen by a young girl. He only got this exclusive fan girl who could listen to his voice. Is she the woman he was looking for?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53062627), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H035196813), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H035196813), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=5132858), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116000001), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000052778)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://ac.qq.com/Comic/comicInfo/id/646091)",
